    "detailed_description": "Gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is an exploratory horror game.<br />\r\nYou can open and close doors and shelves, turn light switches on and off, and inspect objects.<br />\r\nIf you find something of interest or a change, examine it anyway.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFear Experience<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRealistic visuals, lighting, and 3D sound allow you to feel fear as you explore.<br />\r\nIt is strongly influenced by that legendary playable teaser.<br />\r\nThere are jumpscares and gore, but you will enjoy the quiet moments of fear and not knowing what to expect.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Ending<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is only one ending for this game.<br />\r\nThe estimated time to complete the game is 60 to 120 minutes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVideo Distribution Guidelines<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo permission is required from any individual or corporation.<br />\r\nHowever, the following guidelines must be adhered to.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInclude the words \u201c209\u201d and \u201cKANEGON GAMES\u201d in the video and distribution title. <br />\r\nNotify viewers of your intention to play the game at least 3 days prior to the start of the streaming. <br />\r\n\u3000Added on 29/08/2024<br />\r\n\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000(Any media can be used for the announcement. Three days are set aside for viewers to check the store page in advance)<br />\r\nDo not distribute the game with a paid plan such as a channel membership. <br />\r\nAgree that the producer will not be held liable for any damages resulting from playing this game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe above is subject to change without notice.",
